The  utility  provides IPv6‐to‐IPv4 TCP relaying.  It can only be
used on an IPv4/v6 dual stack router.  When receives traffic,  it
will relay the traffic to The destination for the relayed connec‐
tion will be determined by the last 4 octets of the original des‐
tination.   For  example,  if is reserved for and the destination
address is the traffic will be relayed to IPv4 destination To use
the translation service, an IPv6 address prefix must be  reserved
for  mapping  IPv4  addresses  into.  The kernel must be properly
configured to route all the TCP connections toward  the  reserved
IPv6 address prefix into the pseudo interface, using the command.
